ll the matter in  our solar system and turn it into a  supercomputer a thousand times as  efficient as the best computer we have  today and let it run until the heat  death of the universe it still would not  crack your password so we get into some  really astronomical numbers that are  almost impossible to comprehend but the  short the short version is it's secure  yeah I mean it's sort of the idea of if  you take a penny and you double it every  day for a while that doubling does not  have that significant of an impact on  how much money you have but at the end  of a month you're all of a sudden  talking about a huge amount of money  that's a perfect that's a perfect  analogy it's exactly the same we've been  speaking with Aaron Lasher who is the  chief strategy officer at BRD you can  find out more about BRD by using the  link down in the video description and  you can always get in touch with me  about what you want to hear about  related to cryptocurrency blockchain  technology and the like Aaron really  really great to have you on today thanks  so much David
 

